# Quantrove workspace: TEXT-ONLY repo (docs + code). Media never goes to GitHub.
# Step 1: ignore everything...
*
# Step 2: ...then allow folders and text/code file types only
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.py
!*.json
!*.ts
!*.tsx
!*.js
!*.mjs
!*.css
!*.html
!*.ps1
!*.bat
!*.code-workspace

# Never commit (even if the type is allowed)
node_modules/
__pycache__/
out/
99_ARCHIVE/
**/TIMELINE_MEDIA/
**/pipeline/_legacy/
package-lock.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/hooks/gate_log.jsonl
.claude/_disabled_tasks/
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
token.json
client_secret*.json
**/sample-data/
